        <mxCell id="uiTQ7T1-xmgOCRx8Zw91-2" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;The process starts when a company receives an enquiry email from a customer interested in buying a machine tool or machine tending solution. The customer has a need to increase production. The company will reply back asking for more information; if they don&#39;t reply, the process finishes. If they reply, the requirements definition, a bad requirements understanding can produce a cost of failure in the supplier company.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="xF8kSWalujdfLcc4dFP9-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="229" y="22" width="420" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0HU19Ht36EH2sU2hcAbe-1" value="Knowing the processes we are in the search of the machine tool that will satisfy the production in terms of time and quality. Most of the machine tools can perform all the machining operations, but some are most suitable in terms of space and performance" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;" parent="xF8kSWalujdfLcc4dFP9-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="969" y="30" width="160" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uiTQ7T1-xmgOCRx8Zw91-5" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;If&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;we are close to the target throughput we will start the revisions. Just increasing the cutting parameters or changing some operations we could reach the solution for the customer. This information will be provided by an expert who is also a machinist. Of course, we need to verify that our machine tool is still compliant; otherwise, we need to change it. If we need to change it, probably for one more powerful, we could use the candidates from the previous search to save some time.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="xF8kSWalujdfLcc4dFP9-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1319" y="22" width="299" height="140.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uiTQ7T1-xmgOCRx8Zw91-12" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;When everything is checked, the layout, simulation, and bill of materials are sent to the sales engineer. He needs to provide a quote with the price and the condition to the customer.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="xF8kSWalujdfLcc4dFP9-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1860" y="150" width="260" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
