        <mxCell id="uiTQ7T1-xmgOCRx8Zw91-7" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;Once we have the machine tool, we know its specifications, torque, speed, dimensions, passive times, ... This will help us calculate the throughput&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="xF8kSWalujdfLcc4dFP9-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1149" y="30" width="159" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uiTQ7T1-xmgOCRx8Zw91-3" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;Once we know how to grip the part, we define and schedule the operations that will follow according to our knowledge to respect the assigned tolerances. Once we know the order of the machining operations, we assign the best cutting parameters to them according to a certain criterion. To do so, we need to understand what speed, more or less (machine tool power), we will have. So we need to preset some unless it is given by the customer. After that, we need to find the cutting tools that will provide those cutting parameters. If we are okay with the time, we can review the machining process with an expert to verify our assumptions.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="xF8kSWalujdfLcc4dFP9-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="679" y="16" width="280" height="193" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="utf_guu_WTmkcLPJ8UZv-2" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Rejection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Email&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="xF8kSWalujdfLcc4dFP9-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1648" y="151" width="78" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="utf_guu_WTmkcLPJ8UZv-3" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="xF8kSWalujdfLcc4dFP9-1" source="utf_guu_WTmkcLPJ8UZv-2" target="8H4uNFnZ9CfENqtzcJ4J-95" edge="1">
