        <mxCell id="8H4uNFnZ9CfENqtzcJ4J-116" value="New Requirements Proposal" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#F05716;" parent="xF8kSWalujdfLcc4dFP9-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1607" y="130" width="100" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="vURSqG4pSTCPtF4qFdkZ-3" value="Manufacturing knowledge allows to associate geometrical features with the most suitable machining technology. Experience enables to understand by rules what the best technology is for a given geometry. i.e. if the percentage of the milling features is considerable higher than the turning features after a human decision process a milling machine tool might be preferred over a multi-axis." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;" parent="xF8kSWalujdfLcc4dFP9-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="491" y="4" width="196" height="196" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="vURSqG4pSTCPtF4qFdkZ-4" value="Clamping a workpiece to a machine tool is a complex decision making. It needs the right technology and the right position for obtaining the workpiece" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;" parent="xF8kSWalujdfLcc4dFP9-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="730" y="20" width="150" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uiTQ7T1-xmgOCRx8Zw91-10" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;If the customer also wants an automatic loading and unloading of the machine tool, the quotation process needs to continue. The first step is to understand the requirements of the cell. How to input material, space for materials, cleaning stations, and engraving. If this is not clear, we can propose a solution, but the customers must agree. If they don&#39;t, the process finished. If they agree, the first asset to be designed is the gripper, which will help understand the robot&#39;s payload and reachability. We might need to use more than one gripper.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="xF8kSWalujdfLcc4dFP9-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1811" y="35" width="289" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kOiMNtn0flNOQ17Imvw0-3" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Verified Ordered Machining Operation List with Cutting Parameters&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="xF8kSWalujdfLcc4dFP9-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="931" y="111" width="100" height="40" as="geometry" />
