        <mxCell id="0HU19Ht36EH2sU2hcAbe-8" value="Once the design is complete, we need to transfer the solution to the simulation team. They check for interferences in the path of the robot, avoiding death angles, full reachability and a good cycle time of the cell. If these premises are not valid, the designer might need to change the layout or the robot. Also, it is essential to check its compliance with machinery safety prior to any submissions to the customer. A changes afterwards will be more expensive." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;" parent="uEQa6J2vhWJCiaBSdhZw-8" vertex="1">
