        <mxCell id="HEQDrxX6C-43D8M50W6--38" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;The process starts when a company receives an enquiry email from a customer interested in buying a machine tool or machine tending solution. The company will reply back asking for more information; if they don&#39;t reply, the process finishes. If they reply to the requirements definition, a bad understanding of the requirements can produce a cost of failure in the supplier company.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="HEQDrxX6C-43D8M50W6--15" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="270" y="540" width="224" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
