        <mxCell id="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-36" value="Communication" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-16">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="540" width="170" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-37" value="" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;" vertex="1" parent="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-16">
          <mxGeometry x="62" y="783" width="60" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-38" value="Info to Database" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-16">
          <mxGeometry x="122" y="793" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-39" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;The process starts when a company receives an enquiry email from a customer interested in buying a machine tool or machine tending solution. The company will reply back asking for more information; if they don&#39;t reply, the process finishes. If they reply to the requirements definition, a bad understanding of the requirements can produce a cost of failure in the supplier company.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-16">
          <mxGeometry x="270" y="540" width="224" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-40" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;The process starts when a company receives an enquiry email from a customer interested in buying a machine tool or machine tending solution. The company will reply back asking for more information; if they don&#39;t reply, the process finishes. If they reply, the requirements definition, a bad requirements unederstanding can produce a cost of failure in the supplier company.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-16">
          <mxGeometry x="271" y="540" width="220" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-41" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;Information about Workflow&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-16">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="880" width="110" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-42" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#F05716;" edge="1" parent="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-16">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="40" y="1010" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="180" y="1010" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-43" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;Information about Revision Process of the Workflow&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#F05716;" vertex="1" parent="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-16">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="1150" width="110" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-44" value="Orange Lines show the revision process when the customer requirements haven&#39;t been satisfied. These branches/loops will be executed a max. amount of&amp;nbsp; times (i.e. three) and you will just enter if you haven&#39;t satisfied the requirements" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-16">
          <mxGeometry x="10" y="1040" width="190" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-45" value="When the customer transfers all the information, the supplier reviews the geometrical information of the workpiece, compares the volume they need to remove and identifies the features that the machine tool needs to create." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-16">
          <mxGeometry x="580" y="600" width="170" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-46" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;Manufacturing knowledge allows to associate geometrical features with the most suitable machining technology. Experience enables to understand by rules what the best technology is for a given geometry. i.e. if the percentage of the milling features is considerable higher than the turning features after a human decision process a milling machine tool might be preferred over a multi-axis.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-16">
          <mxGeometry x="1160" y="400" width="150" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2JPqndW8IlFfgTa_Jfnu-0" value="Clamping a workpiece to a machine tool is a complex decision making. It needs the right technology and the right position for obtaining the workpiece" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-16">
          <mxGeometry x="1164" y="690" width="150" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-47" value="ImplementedTasks" style="" visible="0" parent="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-0" />
        <mxCell id="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-48" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;strokeColor=#33FF99;strokeWidth=3;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="SbeDv9eEClHbdYY0RWsB-47">
